# AXI4-Lite data width converter for the kernel control path:
# Downsizes the 64-bit Coyote user CSR bus (axi_ctrl) to the 32-bit AXI4-Lite
# control interface generated by Vitis HLS for the scalar configuration
# arguments of the processing_node kernel.
# NOTE: Implemented in pure SystemVerilog (hdl/axil_ctrl_dwidth_64_32.sv) to support
# both UltraScale+ and Versal (v80) architectures without Xilinx IP dependencies.
